    'story.adult.3.step.3.line':'You loop the garlands along the lantern stand and hang the bells beneath. Every breeze plays a little song.',
    'story.adult.3.step.4.action':'Tell Kit the concert is ready',
    'story.adult.3.step.4.line':'Garlands, bells, and Mara to open! You planned the whole night. Take a bow, it’s your show too.',
    /* ---- Little Me's stories ---- */
    'story.little.0.title':'A drink for the seedling',
    'story.little.0.offer':'Hello, little gardener! My newest seedling is very thirsty. Can you fill the tiny watering can at my potting bench and help me water it?',
    'story.little.0.step.0.action':'Fill the tiny watering can at the potting bench',
    'story.little.0.step.0.item':'Tiny watering can',
    'story.little.0.step.0.line':'You fill the tiny watering can at the tap. It’s heavy, but you can carry it!',
    'story.little.0.step.1.action':'Water the seedling with Rosa',
    'story.little.0.step.1.line':'Splish, splash! Look, it’s drinking. Tomorrow it will be a tiny bit taller, just like you.',
    'story.little.1.title':'Mara’s lost starfish',
    'story.little.1.offer':'Oh no, my little starfish charm is gone! I had it this morning. Will you help me look for it?',
    'story.little.1.step.0.action':'Look in the shell basket',
    'story.little.1.step.0.line':'Shells, shells, more shells… but no starfish. Maybe it rolled all the way to the pavilion?',
    'story.little.1.step.1.action':'Peek under the lantern stand',
    'story.little.1.step.1.item':'Starfish charm',
    'story.little.1.step.1.line':'Something twinkles under the lantern stand. It’s the starfish!',
    'story.little.1.step.2.action':'Give Mara her starfish',
    'story.little.1.step.2.line':'My starfish! You’re the best finder on the whole island. Here, a hug from the sea.',
    'story.little.2.title':'A drawing for Kit',
    'story.little.2.offer':'The stage needs a poster, and I think you’re just the artist for it. Can you draw me a picture of the sea? Rosa has crayons, and Mara knows the sea best.',
    'story.little.2.step.0.action':'Borrow crayons from Rosa’s drawer',
    'story.little.2.step.0.item':'Crayons',
    'story.little.2.step.0.line':'You find a box of crayons in the drawer: blue, green, sunny yellow and one very pink pink.',
    'story.little.2.step.1.action':'Draw the sea with Mara',
    'story.little.2.step.1.item':'Your drawing of the sea',
    'story.little.2.step.1.line':'Blue waves, a pink sun and a happy fish… Mara says it’s the best sea she has ever seen.',
    'story.little.2.step.2.action':'Give Kit your drawing',
    'story.little.2.step.2.line':'Our very first poster! I’m hanging it right by the stage so everyone sees it. Thank you, artist!',
    'story.little.3.title':'A lullaby for the lanterns',
    'story.little.3.offer':'Shh… the lanterns flicker when they’re sleepy. They say lanterns glow softest after a lullaby. Will you learn one and sing it to them?',
    'story.little.3.step.0.action':'Learn the wave song from Mara',
    'story.little.3.step.0.item':'The wave song',
    'story.little.3.step.0.line':'Mara hums: shh-ahh, shh-ahh, just like the waves. You hum it back, and she claps.',
    'story.little.3.step.1.action':'Ask Rosa for a sleepy lavender sprig',
    'story.little.3.step.1.item':'Lavender sprig',
    'story.little.3.step.1.line':'Lavender for sweet dreams. Hold it close while you sing.',
    'story.little.3.step.2.action':'Sing the lullaby to the lantern',
    'story.little.3.step.2.line':'Shh-ahh, shh-ahh… one by one, the lanterns stop flickering and glow soft and warm.',
    'story.little.3.step.3.action':'Tell Kit the lanterns are glowing',
    'story.little.3.step.3.line':'Look at them! The softest glow I’ve ever seen. That was the best lullaby on the island.',
